#. いや、黒幕は間違いなく、
#. この<CLT 3>学園の中<CLT>にいるはずだよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's no question that the mastermind is <CLT 3>somewhere\n"
"within the school<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. な、何よ…どうして…？
#. 根拠でも見つけたの…？
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"How do you kn-know? Did you find s-some evidence or\n"
"something?"
msgstr ""

#. 情報処理室の奥に、
#. <CLT 3>モノクマを操作する為のパネル<CLT>があったんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In the back of the data center, I found a <CLT 3>panel\n"
"that controls Monokuma<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、あの操作パネルで、
#. モノクマを操ってたんだよ…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind must have been using that to control\n"
"him all this time."
msgstr ""

#. だから間違いないよ！
#. 黒幕はずっと、この<CLT 3>学園の中<CLT>にいるんだ！
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So there can't be any doubt, the mastermind has <CLT 3>been\n"
"inside the school<CLT> all along!"
msgstr ""

#. 間違いない…か…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There can't be any doubt..."
msgstr ""

#. だとすると、黒幕の正体が、
#. この中の誰かだという事も間違いないんだな…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"In which case, there also can be no doubt that the\n"
"mastermind is one of us."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　なんで…？
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr ""

#. 思い出してみろ…
#. 苗木が聞いたという<CLT 3>モノクマの言葉<CLT>だ…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Recall what Makoto told us <CLT 3>Monokuma said to him<CLT>\n"
"earlier..."
msgstr ""

#. 確か、前にも言ったと思うクマ…
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm sure I told you this already, but..."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>の参加者は、
#. 全部で１６人の高校生だけだって…
msgctxt "0011 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...this <CLT 3>killing game<CLT> began with sixteen\n"
"participants, all of them high school students."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、コロシアイ学園生活が始まった後、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園に生きたまま足を踏み入れた人間も…
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And the only people to take a single step in Hope's\n"
"Peak since the killing game began..."
msgstr ""

#. その１６人だけだったクマ。
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...are those sixteen students."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、黒幕がこの学園の中にいるなら、
#. その<CLT 3>１６人の誰か<CLT>だとしか考えられないはずだ。
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So if the mastermind *is* in the school, we have to\n"
"assume it can only be that <CLT 3>16th student<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だ、だけど…
#. その中で…今も生き残ってるのって…
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "But...how'd they m-manage to survive all of this?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺らだけ…？
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So we're the only ones here...?"
msgstr ""

#. お、俺は違うぞ！　黒幕じゃねーかんな！
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I-It's not me! I'm not the mastermind!"
msgstr ""

#. 私だって違うよっ！！
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well it's not me!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、怪しいのは苗木よッ！！
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I blame M-Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうしてボクが！？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!? Why me!?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だって…おかしいじゃない…！
#. あんただけが…処刑を免れてるなんて…ッ！
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"C-Cuz! It's super weird how you're the o-only one who\n"
"survived being executed!"
msgstr ""

#. そうか！　処刑から生き残れたのは、
#. 苗木っち自身が黒幕だったからだな！？
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Oh, I get it! The only way he coulda survived is if he\n"
"was actually the mastermind himself, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. しまった！　バレた！？
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Aww nuts! Ya got me!"
msgstr ""

#. ま、待てよ！
#. お前…何言ってんだよッ！！
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Wait, what are you trying to say!?"
msgstr ""

#. 落ち着いて。慌てる必要はないわ…
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Everyone, calm down. There's no reason to panic."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕の正体なんて、すぐに明らかになるはずよ。
#. 戦刃むくろ殺しの謎を解き明かせばね…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind's true identity will become clear soon\n"
"enough. Just as soon as we find out who killed Mukuro."
msgstr ""

#. それもそうだな…
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That's a good point."
msgstr ""

#. 言い争いをしているより、
#. そっちの謎の解明に頭を使う方が得策か…
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Rather than wasting time bickering, we should put our\n"
"minds to work solving this mystery."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも、頭を使えって言うけどよ…
#. 戦刃むくろの件は、さんざん話し合ったはずだべ？
msgctxt "0029 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, how much time have we already spent\n"
"talking about the murder?"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これ以上…何を話し合えばいいの…？
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "He's r-right. What more is there to t-talk about?"
msgstr ""

#. 話し合うべき事ならあったはずよ。
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you want something to talk about, I think there\n"
"might be one thing..."
msgstr ""

#. まだハッキリしていない、
#. 戦刃むくろの<CLT 3>致命傷<CLT>についてよ。
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We haven't fully established what Mukuro's <CLT 3>fatal\n"
"injury<CLT> was."
msgstr ""

#. え？　でも、致命傷って…
#. <CLT 3>後頭部の傷<CLT>じゃなかったっけ？
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Huh? But...I thought we figured that out. She died\n"
"when she <CLT 3>got hit in the back of the head<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、あれは本当の致命傷じゃないわ。
#. 本当の致命傷は他にあったはず…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No, that isn't actually what killed her. It was\n"
"something entirely different."
msgstr ""

#. …そうよね、苗木君？
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Wouldn't you agree, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. 全身の傷
msgctxt "0036 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The other wounds"
msgstr ""

#. 後頭部の殴打
msgctxt "0037 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The blow to her head"
msgstr ""

#. 前回の学級裁判ではそんな話も出たけれど、
#. 本当にそうかしら…？
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We said the same thing during the last trial, but are\n"
"you sure it's true?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そういえば霧切さんが、後頭部の傷は
#. 死後に受けた可能性が高いって言ってたっけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, now I remember... You said there was a chance the\n"
"blow to her head came *after* she was killed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 腹部のナイフの傷
msgctxt "0041 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The stab wound"
msgstr ""

#. ナイフの傷は偽装工作…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, the stab wound was more camouflage."
msgstr ""

#. 前回の学級裁判で
#. それを証明したのはあなた自身だったわよ。
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You proved that yourself in the last class trial."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そういえばそうだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh yeah, now that you mention it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 本当の致命傷が何か…
#. 答えられないの？
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You can't tell us what the fatal injury was?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当の致命傷…
#. それは、前回の学級裁判では無関係とされた傷…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The actual cause of death... She had other wounds that\n"
"didn't come up in the class trial...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ダメだ。
#. みんなのボクに対する印象が悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh-oh... Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの本当の致命傷か…
#. それって、きっと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro's actual cause of death must have been...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の全身にあった<CLT 3>数多くの傷<CLT>…
#. あれが、彼女の<CLT 3>致命傷<CLT>なんだよ。
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"All of the <CLT 3>wounds<CLT> covering her body... That's what\n"
"really <CLT 3>killed her<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. コラコラ、苗木っち！
#. ちゃんと、モノクマファイルを見たんか？
msgctxt "0051 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, now hold on a second! You did read the Monokuma\n"
"File, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他にも、全身に数多くの傷跡があるが、
#. ここ数日のものではなく、以前からあった傷のようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The body was covered with other wounds, but these\n"
"were at least several days old.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちゃんと書いてあんだろ？
#. あの傷は、ここ数日の傷じゃねーって。
msgctxt "0053 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It made it pretty clear. Those wounds were made *at\n"
"least* a few days ago."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、あれは事件とは関係ねーはずだぞ！！
msgctxt "0054 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So they can't possibly be what killed her!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、戦刃むくろの殺人自体が、
#. ここ数日の事じゃなかったとしたら…？
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Consider this—what if the murder itself took place at\n"
"least a few days ago?"
msgstr ""

#. は…？
msgctxt "0056 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wh-What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の死体が発見されたのは、
#. すでに死後何日か経過した後だったとしたら…
msgctxt "0057 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What if, when we discovered her body, she'd already\n"
"been dead for several days?"
msgstr ""

#. それなら、ここ数日のものじゃない傷が致命傷でも、
#. おかしくはないはずよ？
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If that's true, then naturally the wounds that killed\n"
"her would appear to be however many days old."
msgstr ""

#. お、おかしいわよ…！
msgctxt "0059 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Th-That doesn't make any sense!"
msgstr ""

#. だって…そもそも、あの全身の傷って…
#. ここに来る前からあった傷なのよ…！
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Because...because she had all th-those wounds before\n"
"she ever c-came here!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　どうして、そんな事がわかるの？
msgctxt "0061 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? How do you know that?"
msgstr ""

#. 当たり前でしょ…彼女は<CLT 3>“超高校級の軍人”<CLT>なのよ？
#. という事は…つまり…
msgctxt "0062 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Isn't it o-obvious? She was the <CLT 3>Ultimate Soldier<CLT>,\n"
"right? So that means...y-you know..."
msgstr ""

#. それは違うわね。
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You're wrong."
msgstr ""

#. アハ…否定された…
#. アハハハ…まだ言ってないのに…
msgctxt "0064 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ahaha... She d-denied me... Hahahaha... Before I could\n"
"even s-say anything..."
msgstr ""

#. アハハ……ハッ…ヒッ…アヒ…アヒヒヒ！
#. やめ…ちょッ…本気でおかし…
msgctxt "0065 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Hahah...ha...ahe...hehehe...! Come on—I mean—you think\n"
"I'm—?"
msgstr ""

#. …おかしくないわよッ！！
#. せ、せめて聞いてから否定してよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0066 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'm not weird, okay!? At least l-listen to what I have\n"
"to say b-before you deny me!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>否定されるのが前提なら、
#. 言わなきゃいいのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If you're so sure we're gonna deny you, why bother\n"
"saying it in the first place?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
